<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria offers 3-, 6-mth discount T-bills Monday.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria offers 3-, 6-mth discount T-bills Monday.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Finance Ministry will offer a total of 16 billion lev worth of three-month and six-month discount T-bills with no minimum acceptable price set in advance at auctions on Monday, the central bank said.</p>
<p>Details of the issues follow:</p>
<p> Issue number	   BG3038697002    BG3038797000</p>
<p> Maturity		 three months    six months</p>
<p> Par value		8.0 bln levs    8.0 bln levs</p>
<p> Auction date	   June 16	   June 16</p>
<p> Issue date	     June 18	   June 18</p>
<p> Maturity date	  September 17    December 17</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
